    "compareWith": "Plated Armor",
    "claim": "should_be_more_obscure",
    "reason": "Debuff Reducer is a forgettable Tier 2 item that players rarely associate with health. Its only listed stat is Bonus Health, but its name points to debuffs, so it should not sit at the 10-point tier next to Extra Health. Plated Armor is a well-known tanky item and is more likely to come to mind.",
    "outcome": "rejected-by-comparison"
