    "name": "Cheat Death",
    "compareWith": "Spirit Lifesteal",
    "claim": "should_be_more_obvious",
    "reason": "Cheat Death is a famous Vitality item with a large 200 Bonus Health value, and players closely tie it to survivability. Spirit Lifesteal is better known for lifesteal and spirit power than for health, so it should not rank as more obvious than Cheat Death.",
